              <div class="wrapper-hero">
                <div class="left-hero padding-bottom-24">
                  <div class="gap-4 max-w-450">
                    <p class="text-caps">WE ARE AN AWARD WINNING</p>
                    <h1 class="h1"><span class="span-pink-2">Motion graphics  </span>and design agency</h1>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80">We started in 2019 as a small group of designers making social videos in After Effects. We&#x27;ve grown a lot since then, but the idea hasn&#x27;t changed: give brands top-tier animation and design without the cost and hassle of building an in-house team. Today we cover UI design, 2D, and 3D animation, and we help SaaS and tech companies move their brand forward.</div>
                </div>
                <div id="w-node-_3cd5a31f-7c8a-fb7f-77ca-f0bbf10c008a-749d2628" class="right-hero"><img src="/images/about-us-hero.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-hero"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
