          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 z-index-10 w-container">
          <div class="wrapper-experience">
            <div class="top-exp">
              <h2 class="h2"><span class="span-pink-2">500+ videos </span>made every year</h2>
              <div class="div-center-620">
                <p class="text-16-150 color-white-80">Video and animation are the bread and butter of what we do. Most of our clients come to us to bring their ideas to life, whether it’s a 90-second explainer or 10 to 20 short animations each month in different formats and languages. Our services cover everything from training and explainer videos to hero animations, product launches, and brand visuals.<br><br>We work on a subscription model, giving businesses a dedicated creative team for all their design needs. Clients can submit unlimited projects, and we help prioritize and deliver each one based on their goals and timelines.</p>
              </div>
